@startuml
actor User as U
participant "Envoy AI Gateway" as E
participant Authorino as Auth
participant "Keycloak / Lightbridge" as KC
participant "Lua Model Policy Script" as Lua

U -> E: POST /v1/chat (Model: deepseek-r1)

note right of E: 1. Identity Resolution Phase
E -> Auth: Validate "sk-abc123..."
Auth -> KC: Token Exchange (Lookup Key)
KC --> Auth: Project is restricted to [gpt-4o]
Auth --> E: Attach Headers: x-allowed-models=gpt-4o

note right of E: 2. Lua Enforcement Phase
E -> Lua: Run model-policy.lua
Lua -> Lua: Request is deepseek-r1, but list is [gpt-4o]
Lua --> E: DENY (Not in allowlist)

E --> U: 403 Forbidden
@enduml
